### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@userId = 1
@accountId = 1

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/swagger-ui.html

### ========== USER ==========

### Create User
# @name createUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ivan@example.com",
  "password": "secret123"
}

### Get User
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}

### ========== BANK ACCOUNT ==========

### Create Account
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Тинькофф Black",
  "type": "DEBIT",
  "currencyCode": "RUB",
  "balanceMinor": 250000,
  "color": "#FFDD2D"
}

### List User Accounts
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/accounts

### Get Account
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{accountId}}

### ========== CATEGORY ==========

### Create Custom Category
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Кофе",
  "type": "EXPENSE",
  "color": "#795548",
  "icon": "coffee"
}

### List Categories (system + user)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/categories

### ========== TRANSACTION ==========

### Income: Salary
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bankAccountId": {{accountId}},
  "categoryId": 1,
  "type": "INCOME",
  "amountMinor": 15000000,
  "description": "Зарплата за июль",
  "transactionDate": "2026-07-25"
}

### Expense: Groceries
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bankAccountId": {{accountId}},
  "categoryId": 4,
  "type": "EXPENSE",
  "amountMinor": 345000,
  "description": "Пятёрочка",
  "transactionDate": "2026-07-26"
}

### List User Transactions
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/transactions

### List Account Transactions
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{accountId}}/transactions
